          "**[Mount Batur Sunrise Jeep & Hot Spring](/bali/en/tours/mount-batur-sunrise-jeep-hot-spring)** — from $75, 6-8 hours, pickup around 02:00-03:30, ending in the water instead of on a long walk down.",
