      "¿En qué consiste el protocolo 'Safety First'?",
    "What is the &#39;Safety First&#39; protocol?":
      "¿En qué consiste el protocolo 'Safety First'?",
    "What is the &#039;Safety First&#039; protocol?":
      "¿En qué consiste el protocolo 'Safety First'?",
