      "从巴厘岛出发的 Nusa Penida 一日游：Kelingking、Angel's Billabong 和 Diamond Beach，路线灵活。$75 起，含酒店接送，通过 WhatsApp 预订。",
    "Full-day 佩尼达一日游 from Bali: Kelingking, Angel&#039;s Billabong and Diamond Beach on a flexible route. From $75 with hotel pickup, book on WhatsApp.":
      "从巴厘岛出发的 Nusa Penida 一日游：Kelingking、Angel's Billabong 和 Diamond Beach，路线灵活。$75 起，含酒店接送，通过 WhatsApp 预订。",
    "Galungan is not on Indonesia's national holiday list, so the days off are a Bali provincial dispensation and the rest of the country works. Traffic is local rather than national: families moving between family temples, processions occupying a lane, roadside parking where there is usually none. On Kuningan itself, 27 June 2026, the activity concentrates before noon. A car with a driver is $59 for the day, and that is the line item that absorbs the delay.":
      "Galungan 不在印度尼西亚的全国节假日名单上，因此放假是巴厘省的特许，全国其他地方照常上班。交通压力是地方性的而非全国性的：家庭在各家族庙宇之间往来，游行队伍占用一条车道，平时没有车位的路边停满了车。在 Kuningan 当天，即 2026 年 6 月 27 日，活动集中在中午之前。带司机的用车全天 $59，正是这一项吸收了这些延误。",
