    "Green turtles graze shallow seagrass in 0.5-2 m of water off Gili Trawangan's north-east tip and near Turtle Point on Gili Air, close enough to reach from a beach entry with a mask. Gili Meno's west and north-west are the most reliable of all. Sightings are realistic, not guaranteed, and mornings are calmest and clearest. Keep 2-3 m back, never chase, and never sit between a turtle and the surface.":
      "绿海龟在 Gili Trawangan 东北角外和 Gili Air 的 Turtle Point 附近 0.5-2 米深的浅水海草床上觅食，距离近到戴上面镜从沙滩下水就能到达。Gili Meno 的西岸和西北岸是其中最稳定的。看到海龟是现实的期待，但不能保证，上午海况最平静、能见度最好。请保持 2-3 米距离，绝不追逐，也绝不待在海龟与水面之间。",
